<title>NEW ZEALAND: ASB Bank cuts it variable lending rate to 9.95 pct.</title>
<headline>ASB Bank cuts it variable lending rate to 9.95 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>ASB Bank said on Wednesday it was cutting its variable home lending rate to 9.95 percent.</p>
<p>The move is effective immediately for new customers and on January 27 for existing customers.</p>
<p>It said it was cutting its fixed rates for 1-5 year terms to 8.95 percent.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
